   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 394, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with sixty minutes of debate on the Sensenbrenner amendment.",
